{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object seen, move and take it. Check its properties and complete task. Otherwise, scan. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = CompleteSpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectSeen    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    />",
